[?2004l[?2004h> cursor.execute("SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table';")
[?2004l[?2004h> tables = cursor.fetchall()
[?2004l[?2004h> print("Tables in database:")
[?2004l[?2004h> for table in tables:
